> pr(x: u8) = x where x < 8
> pt(x: u8) = [0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7][x]
> equiv pr ~ pt
pr and pt are equal on the domain of pr (exhaustive)
  domain: x in 0..7 by the where clause (8 points enumerated)
